    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a11bb9351a9226c1",
      "translationZh": "这次发布中我最关注的亮点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c0d6f99731853c45",
      "translationZh": "升级到 OpenAI Python 库 3.x，并将 HTTP 客户端依赖从 httpx 切换为 httpx2。#1608，#1631",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a9ce92ce1c607f8",
      "translationZh": "昨天我发布了 0.32.1，快速修复了这个问题，但这次的修复更全面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df76592d122eb017",
      "translationZh": "llm embed 和 llm embed-multi 现在支持 --key。Python 中的 EmbeddingModel.embed()、EmbeddingModel.embed_multi()、Collection.embed() 和 Collection.embed_multi() 方法也支持 key=，会将为每次调用解析得到的密钥传递给嵌入插件，而不改变共享模型状态。现有读取 self.key 的插件仍可通过兼容性回退机制正常工作。感谢 ChrisJr404。#757，#1620",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2d375ee2fcf6959",
      "translationZh": "嵌入模型现在采用与常规 LLM 模型相同的密钥处理方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5adb0bf2c1f3d699",
      "translationZh": "现在可以重复指定 llm prompt -t/--template，按顺序组合模板。这样就可以将一个模板中的模型配置和选项，与另一个模板中的提示词搭配使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27d70fdfa440f68a",
      "translationZh": "这带来了一种巧妙的用法：你可以创建模板，将模型与一组默认选项打包在一起：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf15101cec229597",
      "translationZh": "Responses API 中具备推理能力的模型现在支持 reasoning_summary 选项，可选值为 auto、concise 和 detailed。此选项可与 llm openai endpoint --responses 搭配使用。#1600",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e041469851dfc8c",
      "translationZh": "这对于测试那些提供各自的 OpenAI Responses API 仿制实现的不同模型尤其有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
